vdr-skin-anthra-1920-ost (20190209-1fnu0~trixie) trixie; urgency=medium

  * New upstream version 20190209: the Makefile sorts the XML parts before
    joining them, so the skin does not depend on the directory order.
  * Repackaged for Debian 13: debhelper 13, Standards-Version 4.7.2,
    Rules-Requires-Root: no, Multi-Arch: foreign, Section video.
  * The skin is no longer generated at package build time and made
    writable for vdr by chown in /usr. vdr-skin-anthra-update from
    vdr-skin-anthra-common builds it on installation and on request from
    the sources in /usr/share/vdr-skin-anthra/anthra_1920_OSt
    and the options in the conffile /etc/vdr/anthra/anthra_1920_OSt.conf
    into /var/lib/vdr/plugins/text2skin/anthra_1920_OSt.
    Local options survive upgrades.
  * Build the translations from po/ and validate the skin with the default
    options against the text2skin RELAX NG schema (xmlstarlet).
  * Drop the make-config patch, paths and defaults are in the conffile now.
  * Install only the themes of this skin, upstream also ships
    anthra_1920_FSt-default.theme (in vdr-skin-anthra-1920-fst) and
    anthra_1920_OS-light.theme.
  * Machine-readable debian/copyright (DEP-5). Maintainer Frank Neumann
    <fnu@vdr-portal.de>.

 -- Frank Neumann <fnu@vdr-portal.de>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:44:48 +0200

